Make wifi dongle hotspot if AP(Access Point) module is in it.

-----------------------------------------
Check device
~$ nmcli device status
DEVICE         TYPE      STATE                   CONNECTION 
wlp41s0f4u1i2  wifi      connected               geek 2     
lo             loopback  connected (externally)  lo         
docker0        bridge    connected (externally)  docker0    
enp37s0        ethernet  unavailable             --         
---------------------------------------
Hotspot connection
~$ nmcli device wifi hotspot \
    ifname wlp41s0f3u4i2 \
    ssid AntHotspot \
    password yourPassword


