nmcli device status

create the hotspot

If the interface is wlan0:

nmcli device wifi hotspot \
    ifname wlan0 \
    ssid AntHotspot \
    password yourPassword

If it's wlp41s0f3u4i2:

nmcli device wifi hotspot \
    ifname wlp41s0f3u4i2 \
    ssid AntHotspot \
    password yourPassword
